      "description": "The phrase 'this one time at camp' is a well-known comedic trope, often used to introduce a humorous, exaggerated, or absurd anecdote, typically involving a mishap or embarrassing situation. This structure is a cultural reference from comedy and internet memes, implying a lighthearted, often crude, story.",
