      "description": "The overall emotional tone of the image is humorous, conveyed through the juxtaposition of a mundane industrial scene with the crude, taboo-laden text overlay 'this one time at camp' and 'someone had too much gas.' The humor derives from the absurdity of applying a camp anecdote structure to a serious industrial setting and the use of vulgar euphemism for flatulence, which is a form of taboo humor.",
